# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Format: <source> <destination> <status>
# Rules are evaluated top to bottom; the first match wins. Limit: 2100 rules,
# of which 100 may be dynamic (containing * or :placeholder).
#
# www -> apex. This only takes effect once www.iazzus.com is attached to the
# Pages project as a custom domain. A Cloudflare Redirect Rule at the zone
# level is the more robust option and is documented in the README; keeping
# both is harmless because the zone-level rule runs first.
https://www.iazzus.com/* https://iazzus.com/:splat 301

# Section moves. The motorcycle page moved under the Garage hub; keep this
# so any link that was already shared still resolves.
/motorcycle/*  /garage/motorcycle/:splat  301
/motorcycle    /garage/motorcycle/        301
